    <!--Designer-->
    <s id="DesignerParts.CarbonDioxideFilter.CarbonDioxideFilter.Name">Carbon Dioxide Filter</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.CarbonDioxideFilter.CarbonDioxideFilter.Description">A Filter to remove &lt;color=red&gt;Carbon Dioxide&lt;/color&gt; when you don't want to make use of it, the device simply throws the waste CarbonDioxide out of craft using electricity charge to operate</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.ChemicalReactor.ChemicalReactor.Name">Chemical Reactor</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.ChemicalReactor.ChemicalReactor.Description">A Tiny Chemical Reactor for ISRU use, pick the right reaction type before putting it into use.</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.DOCRDevice.DOCRDevice.Name">&lt;color=red&gt;&lt;size=150%&gt;Drood Organic Classification and Recycling Device</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.DOCRDevice.DOCRDevice.Description">&lt;color=red&gt;&lt;size=150%&gt;Sometimes, for the greater good, your crew need to SACRIFICE themselves......&lt;/size&gt;&lt;/color&gt;</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.ElectrolyticDevice.ElectrolyticDevice.Name">Electrolytic Device</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.ElectrolyticDevice.ElectrolyticDevice.Description">Electrolytic Device, which turns &lt;color=yellow&gt;water&lt;/color&gt; to &lt;color=green&gt;oxygen&lt;/color&gt;, requires electricity to run</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.FoodTank.FoodTank.Name">Food Tank</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.FoodTank.FoodTank.Description">A container with &lt;color=yellow&gt;food&lt;/color&gt;</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.GasDepressurizeDevice.GasDepressurizeDevice.Name">Gas Depressurize Device</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.GasDepressurizeDevice.GasDepressurizeDevice.Description">Used to Depressurize high pressure gas or liquid gas to low pressure gas.</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.GasPressurizeDevice.GasPressurizeDevice.Name">Gas Pressurize Device</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.GasPressurizeDevice.GasPressurizeDevice.Description">Used to compress the low density gas to high pressure gas or Liquid Gas</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.HibernatingChamber.HibernatingChamber.Name">Hibernating Chamber</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.HibernatingChamber.HibernatingChamber.Description">Wanna make your crew sleep for a little bit longer? This is what you want</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.MethaloxGenerator.MethaloxGenerator.Name">Methalox Generator</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.MethaloxGenerator.MethaloxGenerator.Description">A device turning &lt;color=red&gt;High Pressure CO2&lt;/color&gt;, &lt;color=red&gt;Water&lt;/color&gt; into &lt;color=green&gt;Methalox&lt;/color&gt;</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.PhotoBioReactor.PhotoBioReactor.Name">PhotoBio Reactor</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.PhotoBioReactor.PhotoBioReactor.Description">When &lt;color=green&gt;Active&lt;/color&gt;, turning CO2/Water to Oxygen and Food, powered by solar or electricity. Solid Waste will boost the food generation</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.ResourcesFuselage.ResourcesFuselage.Name">Resources Fuselage</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.ResourcesFuselage.ResourcesFuselage.Description">Versatile fuel tank that can be resized into many shapes and can hold many different types of &lt;color=green&gt;Life Support Resources&lt;/color&gt;</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.ResourcesPack.ResourcesPack.Name">Resources Pack</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.ResourcesPack.ResourcesPack.Description">A quicker choice if you don't want to spend time setting and placing the life support resources tanks one by one, this part integrates necessary resources for &lt;color=green&gt;a single Drood&lt;/color&gt; to consume in 24 hours.</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.SewageTreatDevice.SewageTreatDevice.Name">Sewage Treat Device</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.SewageTreatDevice.SewageTreatDevice.Description">A Device which processes &lt;color=red&gt;Wasted Water&lt;/color&gt; to Clean &lt;color=green&gt;Drinking Water&lt;/color&gt;. Powered by Electricity</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.SodiumPeroxideContainer.SodiumPeroxideContainer.Name">Sodium Peroxide Container</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.SodiumPeroxideContainer.SodiumPeroxideContainer.Description">Taking in CO2/Wasted Water and giving out &lt;color=green&gt;Oxygen&lt;/color&gt; in an emergency, does not require electricity charge to work</s>
    
    <s id="DesignerParts.ToolKit.ToolKit.Name">Tool Kit</s>
    <s id="DesignerParts.ToolKit.ToolKit.Description">A tool kit which resupplies engineers' repair tools</s>
    
